cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "J-IoU: junction-restricted evaluation for 3D plant organ segmentation"
abstract: >-
  Evaluation code for J-IoU, a junction-restricted protocol that scores 3D
  plant organ segmentation only within a narrow band around ground-truth organ
  boundaries, together with a geometric label check for annotated plant
  point clouds and the label corrections for Pheno4D used in the paper.
